  "details": "the max limit for group categories is really limiting, with the 1st category used up for banner related images. \n\nAs community groups get bigger there will definitely be need for more categories. \n\nFor my own group at the moment, I want to have a category for the following:\n\n1. world update/previews\n\n2. user submitted screenshots from my worlds\n\n3. World records (speedrun times/ time trial times etc)\n\n4.+ world specific categories\n\nSince the categories all share the same image limit, I don't see why its limited ot a max of 3.",
